{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午11時53分，土瓜灣馬坑涌道2C號地下一間大排檔的閘門被人撬開，店內有搜掠痕跡，懷疑遭人爆竊。警方到場調查，正向職員了解。經初步點算後，大排檔損失逾10萬元現金。案件目前列作爆竊，警方正追緝涉案賊人。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員進入餐廳調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189208254497296384796801.jpeg/RiEn7aY-3OKjlobBtTd9nzYf1RHvGsQO7vZTkcv2U5E\"/><figcaption>警員進入餐廳調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員進入餐廳調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189208251808616448384509.jpeg/QqOF15IkK7ZjHxi2RYuKLTd55T2LqhQkHLeN8jm3jfI\"/><figcaption>警員進入餐廳調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一間大排檔。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189208249128325120839014.jpeg/7zrMC3Ot1gekBkxrb75qBOpWHHm-ufdqNDYVBRE2FQU\"/><figcaption>現場是一間大排檔。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一間大排檔。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189208246301233152098245.jpeg/bFcgOSyTyGBHx6CYW-FYjChcfit2NxJ1p_V8CoL1fAo\"/><figcaption>現場是一間大排檔。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.422504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:54:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:35.520581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:11.208548+00:00","content_hash":"c569132f1249e2b38fb2946f582b9b1ecb3954dd59619f8b79b21b2d69dab7dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}